# Five-Stage RV32I Core

## Overview

`rv32i_core.sv` integrates the processor datapath and control logic into a five-stage, single-issue, in-order RV32I core.

```text
IF -> ID -> EX -> MEM -> WB
```

The current core is verified using a Harvard-style instruction/data memory model. AXI-Lite integration is the next project milestone.

