## Known Limitations

- No CSR implementation
- No privileged ISA
- No exceptions or interrupts
- No architectural trap vector or handler
- No RV32M extension
- No RV32A extension
- No compressed instructions
- No caches
- No branch predictor
- Branch/jump resolution occurs in MEM
- No processor AXI-Lite master adapter yet
- No firmware execution through the AXI-Lite subsystem yet

## Next Integration Step

Implement an adapter that converts the core's instruction/data handshakes into AXI-Lite transactions, then connect it to the verified RAM/GPIO/Timer subsystem.
